ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c7qzJJ3gaAQQ7kNvwHkt9Sg&_nc_oc=Adqvxfst-uay9TN10a4cKtqeevVksu11heQeW8DosCprC0yG6c98dLjhimW-4MNpYgE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSPCdC5rl0fjl1BAUVkc1ZmWwtocS9RT2ihLAtxnnxEWw&oe=6B0B2806"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nWHF0AspfQEQ7kNvwHI477V&_nc_oc=AdpVUeyTlNn1-4Tr8TLic2r7r22CjRAJuubRASsee0BV9UM-MCoZFKq-f0tGu18c0-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSrEEJlud8mLeQWEUbJpzMYynXUjyk-uJzHgxmeZ-ybIg&oe=6B0B1060"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j6FUPJ5-YVgQ7kNvwGNmmcz&_nc_oc=AdoNEp5t9n_FVdL5fs4TDos93yZUA0K0vIvM19Owxpqk1UvebzbofTbR7vJPu1sVay8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT_B-BSZsdKSgaL3L1OGsM0dIZvrtDP_JFNntu5uCFYAw&oe=6B0B2F11"}, {